    },
    {
      "text": "The Co-free FeNiCrMn alloy is in a solid-solution state.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Removing Co alters the dislocation core structure of the alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Removing Co favors edge-dislocation activity at lower temperatures.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Removing Co causes an earlier transition to dynamic recovery or twinning at elevated temperatures and/or higher strain rates.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Changes in dislocation character and recovery or twinning account for the dynamic strength–ductility balance of Co-free FeNiCrMn.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant comparison can be conducted from room temperature to 900 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7229066::rubric_card::000::3519eb0b1c"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant strain-rate regime extends from 1×10^-4 to 1×10^-3 s^-1.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7229066::rubric_card::000::3519eb0b1c"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed mechanism applies only while the alloys remain single-phase solid solutions without secondary-phase precipitation.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Eliminating Co modifies local bonding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Eliminating Co modifies stacking-fault energy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The bonding and stacking-fault-energy changes weaken stabilization of screw-dislocation cores.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dominant edge-dislocation activity at lower temperatures produces high initial yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At higher temperatures and increased strain rates, enhanced mobility and dynamic recrystallization or twinning accommodate plastic deformation and preserve ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to CoCrFeMnNi, Co-free FeNiCrMn will have higher yield strength at lower temperatures.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to CoCrFeMnNi, Co-free FeNiCrMn will show more pronounced strain-rate sensitivity.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to CoCrFeMnNi, Co-free FeNiCrMn will transition earlier to twinning or dynamic recovery at elevated temperatures.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
